  "caption": "Cantonese guitar post-punk, current Hong Kong underground band style. Trebly, chorus-heavy lead guitar riffs; a driving melodic bass played high on the neck carrying the tune; tight motorik drums with insistent hi-hat; scratchy muted rhythm guitar. Raw live-room band sound, cold reverb on the guitars. Male baritone, flat deadpan delivery that breaks into shouts on the hooks. 142 BPM, E minor. Restless, dry and absurdly stubborn. No synthesizers, no autotune, no pop-punk, no metal riffs, no EDM.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n打賭輸咗畀阿強\n要行上獅子山\n佢話唔准換波鞋\n要着返工嗰對\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n皮鞋 新嘅\n鞋底 滑嘅\n\n[Chorus]\n着住皮鞋上獅子山\n一步一步吱吱聲\n着住皮鞋上獅子山\n後面阿婆行過我先\n\n[Verse]\n石級一級比一級高\n腳趾頂住鞋頭\n對襪濕晒貼住腳\n我話我仲得\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n半山 起泡\n山頂 未到\n\n[Chorus]\n着住皮鞋上獅子山\n跑山佬望住我笑\n着住皮鞋上獅子山\n鞋踭甩咗都要行\n\n[Verse]\n終於企喺塊大石\n成個九龍喺腳底\n阿強幫我影張相\n話好似去見工\n\n[Bridge]\n落山先至最痛\n我除咗鞋行返落去\n\n[Chorus]\n赤住對腳落獅子山\n隻手揸住對鞋\n赤住對腳落獅子山\n下次唔再同你賭\n\n[Outro]\n獅子山\n仲有對鞋",
